:hasAnnual75thPercentileWage rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                             rdfs:label "has hourly 75th percentile wage"@en ;
                             skos:definition "A datatype property that relates an information content entity to a string denoting an annual 75th percentile wage."@en .


###  http://example.org/OntologyTradecraft/core/hasAnnual90thPercentileWage
:hasAnnual90thPercentileWage rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
